      "writtenOn": "2023-01-25T03:54:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the system is unable to generate a random number then we probably need to do something more than return zero. We should probably throw a SW panic similar to what is done in stm32 chips. See  http://cs/chromeos_public/src/platform/ec/chip/stm32/trng.c;l\u003d27 for reference",
